1
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:05,035
Hi, Jacky! What a beautiful day!
嗨，奇奇！今天天气真好呀！

2
00:00:05,285 --> 00:00:08,861
Hi, Soda! Yes, it is! Do you want to go out and play?
嗨，小苏打！是呀！你想出去玩吗？

3
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,639
Sure! That sounds fun! Where do you want to go?
当然！听起来真好玩！你想去哪儿玩？

4
00:00:13,889 --> 00:00:14,946
Let’s go to the park!
我们去公园吧！

5
00:00:15,196 --> 00:00:17,831
Great idea! Let’s go!
好主意！我们出发吧！

6
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:21,199
Come on, Soda! Let’s have some fun!
快来呀，小苏打！我们去玩个痛快吧！

7
00:00:21,449 --> 00:00:24,177
Wait for me! I can run super fast!
等等我！我跑得可快啦！

8
00:00:24,427 --> 00:00:26,645
Haha! Let’s see who gets there first!
哈哈！看看谁先到！

9
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,467
Ready, set, go!
预备，开始，跑！
